s/2a8ac474ed2ccd55208236bb6023f557.webm?t=1738605527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373800/extras/2a8ac474ed2ccd55208236bb6023f557.mp4?t=1738605527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>And More...</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up and expand your area</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find treasure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build roads to speed up farmers</p></li></ul>",
